libreac (1.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * libreac 1.10.0: the qdisc read-back has its witness and walks no byte it
    did not read
  * fuzz: fuzz_qdisc drives the etf qdisc read-back over a fake rtnetlink
    kernel, and the dump walker stops at the bytes recv() returned (#8)
  * reac_code: declare reac-pw's last three tokens, E_NOT_MARKED, E_KNOCK_TX
    and E_WAKE_EDGE (#8)

